1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,827
The price has been agreed.

2
00:00:02,827 --> 00:00:07,407
Many digital buying journeys
end at this point with a message:

3
00:00:07,407 --> 00:00:09,370
"A salesperson will contact you."

4
00:00:09,370 --> 00:00:14,375
Kopilotti aims to carry an accepted deal
further, in a controlled way.

5
00:00:14,375 --> 00:00:18,425
However, the money does not
flow through Kopilotti.

6
00:00:20,100 --> 00:00:23,161
The language model
does not decide the price.

7
00:00:23,161 --> 00:00:25,651
The dealer sets the limits,

8
00:00:25,651 --> 00:00:29,801
and the server side returns
an acceptance, a counter-offer,

9
00:00:29,801 --> 00:00:32,291
a rejection, or escalation for review.

10
00:00:32,291 --> 00:00:34,269
After acceptance,

11
00:00:34,269 --> 00:00:37,565
the price and the deal
are confirmed on the server.

12
00:00:40,100 --> 00:00:43,993
The accepted decision is bound
to the correct vehicle,

13
00:00:43,993 --> 00:00:46,329
dealer and deal.

14
00:00:46,329 --> 00:00:49,000
The same core can also lock the vehicle,

15
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:52,930
so the same car cannot end up
with two customers.

16
00:00:52,930 --> 00:00:57,870
A price reported by the browser or
the language model is not authoritative.

17
00:01:00,100 --> 00:01:03,452
The next step can be payment.

18
00:01:03,452 --> 00:01:07,940
Kopilotti is neither a payment service
nor a payee.

19
00:01:07,940 --> 00:01:11,130
The customer pays the dealership directly

20
00:01:11,130 --> 00:01:14,319
through the dealership's own
payment service or bank.

21
00:01:14,319 --> 00:01:16,819
Kopilotti can initiate the payment flow,

22
00:01:16,819 --> 00:01:19,319
but card details and bank credentials

23
00:01:19,319 --> 00:01:22,444
are not shared with Kopilotti
or the language model.

24
00:01:24,100 --> 00:01:28,402
The customer cannot mark
the payment as completed themselves.

25
00:01:28,402 --> 00:01:32,926
Payment status comes verified
directly from the payment provider.

26
00:01:32,926 --> 00:01:36,141
The confirmation is bound
to the correct deal,

27
00:01:36,141 --> 00:01:39,356
amount and payment provider reference.

28
00:01:39,356 --> 00:01:42,500
Once the confirmation is accepted
on the server side,

29
00:01:42,500 --> 00:01:46,513
the deal can be marked
as paid and locked.

30
00:01:47,100 --> 00:01:51,958
Financing and contracts
are external integrations.

31
00:01:51,958 --> 00:01:55,097
Kopilotti does not make credit decisions

32
00:01:55,097 --> 00:01:58,236
or replace the dealership's
back-office system.

33
00:01:58,236 --> 00:02:01,826
Kopilotti guides the sales process

34
00:02:01,826 --> 00:02:05,416
and hands the verified commercial state
over to the next system.

35
00:02:08,100 --> 00:02:11,883
In the public demo,
no payment is initiated.

36
00:02:11,883 --> 00:02:16,676
Payment and financing
are separate integrations.

37
00:02:16,676 --> 00:02:19,532
The direction is clear: conversation,

38
00:02:19,532 --> 00:02:21,674
rule-bound negotiation,

39
00:02:21,674 --> 00:02:23,816
an accepted deal, a payment flow,

40
00:02:23,816 --> 00:02:25,958
and a verified outcome.

41
00:02:25,958 --> 00:02:28,688
The language model converses.

42
00:02:28,688 --> 00:02:31,438
The server side decides.

43
00:02:31,438 --> 00:02:35,036
The dealer stays in control.
